        "section": "ai-engineering",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - LLM Concepts",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nBPE algorithm (Sennrich et al. 2015, adopted by GPT family):\n  Start: vocabulary = individual bytes (256 entries)\n  Repeat until target vocab size (50k–100k):\n    Count all adjacent token pairs in corpus\n    Merge the most frequent pair into a single new token\n  Result: frequent subwords become single tokens"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-LLM-CONCEPTS.md#014",
      "path": [
        "01-LLM-CONCEPTS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:ai-engineering:01-llm-concepts, git-history:ai-engineering:01-llm-concepts]",
        "canonical_path": "ai-engineering/01-LLM-CONCEPTS.md",
        "concepts": "[llm, concepts]",
        "current_path": "ai-engineering/01-LLM-CONCEPTS.md",
        "id": "maxim:ai-engineering:llm-concepts",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "ai-engineering",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[llm, concepts]",
        "section": "ai-engineering",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - LLM Concepts",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Examples (GPT-4 tokenizer):\n  \"tokenization\"   → [\"token\", \"ization\"]       2 tokens\n  \"untokenizable\"  → [\"un\", \"token\", \"izable\"]  3 tokens\n  \" Hello\"         → [\" Hello\"]                 1 token (leading space matters)\n  \"hello\"          → [\"hello\"]                  1 token\n  \"HELLO\"          → [\"HE\", \"LLO\"]             2 tokens (different case = different token)\n  \"12345\"          → [\"123\", \"45\"]             2 tokens (numbers vary)\n  \"1+1=2\"          → [\"1\", \"+\", \"1\", \"=\", \"2\"] 5 tokens\n```"
    },
    {
